Al Friday Season 2 - Problem Statements
Al-Based Infrastructure Capacity Planning Advisor
PROBLEM STATEMENT
IT infrastructure teams struggle to interpret capacity reports and plan for scaling due to complex metrics and forecasts.
Manual analysis leads to either overprovisioning or resource shortages affecting service levels. An Al tool that generates clear capacity planning advice from raw metrics is needed.
Data Considerations (Guidelines):
Sample infrastructure monitoring data (CPU, memory, storage usage), historical scaling decisions, and threshold policies. Data can be static or simple CSV files.
Feel free to generate synthetic data where appropriate using the provided environment
SOLUTION EXPECTATIONS
A web Ul where infrastructure metrics are uploaded and Al outputs a capacity planning report (3-5 sentences) with recommended actions, justifications, and risk warnings. This improves resource allocation and cost efficiency.
Be creative to go beyond as you solve the above needs
